      "description": "<p>You cloak the target in a veil of magic that is toxic to enemies. Until this spell ends, any creature that performs a melee attack against the target takes <strong>10</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-id=\"tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-type=\"Item\">Poison</a> damage. The attacker takes this damage <strong>even if the attack misses</strong>.</p><hr contenteditable=\"false\"><p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 20</strong> ― This damage becomes <strong>15</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-id=\"tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-type=\"Item\">Poison</a>.</p><p><strong>Skill Enhancement Lv. 40</strong> ― This damage becomes <strong>20</strong> <a class=\"content-link\" data-uuid=\"Item.tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-id=\"tDcCWc67Ary9nVxe\" data-type=\"Item\">Poison</a>.</p>",
